                        "target_lang_word": "energetisch",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "energetisch",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23c2ac1e-85d8-3727-ad27-5796bb659665",
                                        "entry_id": "d33cbd8f-3c4e-38c4-92f5-fad40ea4b614",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "in Bezug auf die Energie"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1f63e9d-4ef1-48df-8890-3d6a2fd479f3",
                                                "sense_id": "23c2ac1e-85d8-3727-ad27-5796bb659665",
                                                "text": "Stofflich ist die Bilanz ausgeglichen, aber energetisch ist sie positiv."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7740eaea-2054-4e12-ad84-d10740ff6924",
                                                "sense_id": "23c2ac1e-85d8-3727-ad27-5796bb659665",
                                                "text": "„Im Zuge der bundesdeutschen Energiewende steht eine riesige Zahl von Bestandsimmobilien vor einer energetischen Sanierung.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90301340-950c-4c2e-a04e-a25aea280155",
                                                "sense_id": "23c2ac1e-85d8-3727-ad27-5796bb659665",
                                                "text": "[Rund ein Drittel der Altbauten muss] „erst umfassend energetisch saniert werden, bevor eine Erdwärmeheizung installiert werden kann.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d99477d-ddf1-4ec2-9116-e78e89687254",
                                                "sense_id": "23c2ac1e-85d8-3727-ad27-5796bb659665",
                                                "text": "[Deutschland:] „2023 wurden gut 73 Millionen Kubikmeter Holz geerntet. Davon wurden knapp 50 Millionen Kubikmeter stofflich genutzt (Bauholz, Papierindustrie, Chemieindustrie, Möbel), der Rest energetisch.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6cffee5f-d4d2-449b-9232-06a41991847f",
                        "source_entry_id": "33965112-6ec6-3178-bc42-639f6385a8ca",
                        "source_sense_id": "ff7c3309-cb74-30d4-b95c-50681e369722",
                        "source_sense_description": "met betrekking tot arbeid of energie",
                        "target_lang_word": "energetic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "energetic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec0c42e7-b9ef-3872-ae07-1fd2d2aa65a9",
                                        "entry_id": "e0852e9f-453d-358e-9b7c-7200bfcb7f1b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Possessing or pertaining to energy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b2a8c26-65d2-488e-b21b-987c80a78fc9",
                                                "sense_id": "ec0c42e7-b9ef-3872-ae07-1fd2d2aa65a9",
                                                "text": "Cosmic rays are energetic particles from outer space."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a211959d-a0d0-4d82-b8b8-3298ac823e29",
                                                "sense_id": "ec0c42e7-b9ef-3872-ae07-1fd2d2aa65a9",
                                                "text": "energetic laws"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a68aa9ea-9a3d-473a-9bde-fa8665de63ce",
                                                "sense_id": "ec0c42e7-b9ef-3872-ae07-1fd2d2aa65a9",
                                                "text": "Now lift the inverted jar so that the air can get at the outside of the “porous cup” and instantly the energetic illuminating gas which is now inside the “porous cup” begins to come out, and the water rises in the glass tube to take its place."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8114133-f844-3bc0-8ed2-592dd659f680",
                                        "entry_id": "e0852e9f-453d-358e-9b7c-7200bfcb7f1b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characterised by force or vigour; full of energy; lively, vigorous, furious."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a516c58-f938-45d0-99ec-891435714b20",
                                                "sense_id": "e8114133-f844-3bc0-8ed2-592dd659f680",
                                                "text": "Those kids are so energetic: they want to run around playing all day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "875842c6-cd50-4097-a90c-e2a3103c3640",
                                                "sense_id": "e8114133-f844-3bc0-8ed2-592dd659f680",
                                                "text": "They are even now insulted with all the arguments which have been used in favor of energetic governments, ever since the days of Pharaoh: but every one knew, long before our revolution, that an energetic government could be supported […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d6524d0-bfb4-3761-95d1-6d3a1b642f61",
                                        "entry_id": "e0852e9f-453d-358e-9b7c-7200bfcb7f1b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having powerful effects; efficacious, potent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1dcb41b3-5776-447c-9617-3daa6b4c2eda",
                                                "sense_id": "2d6524d0-bfb4-3761-95d1-6d3a1b642f61",
                                                "text": "At these energetic sounds, the sun hid himself beneath a gloomy cloud; and the waters of two little lakes, that were naturally clearer than crystal, became of a colour like blood."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "energetic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f796cd19-5048-34a4-8908-d167bda657d0",
                                        "entry_id": "f9588cd4-3660-3cad-a4ab-d5db695b52da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any material used for its release of energy, either as an explosive, propellant, or for pyrotechnic effects."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49d1831a-fa54-4908-8fb3-70ccd8809bcc",
                                                "sense_id": "f796cd19-5048-34a4-8908-d167bda657d0",
                                                "text": "Unfortunately, conventional nanoporous energetics can have poor long-term storage stability, and can be dangerously unstable, severely limiting their usefulness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd6c2916-e4e1-48f7-bc74-2e57f816260d",
                                                "sense_id": "f796cd19-5048-34a4-8908-d167bda657d0",
                                                "text": "Improved energetics can help the Department of Defense build smaller munitions that still pack a punch."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e38cd56-902e-4cda-9807-3f6adb588ed4",
                                                "sense_id": "f796cd19-5048-34a4-8908-d167bda657d0",
                                                "text": "Where I will say there is something that we all have to watch is the underlying suppliers, the suppliers of solid rockets motors, of batteries, of energetics."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c0fb58ac-bf1e-405c-a621-161374e02082",
                        "source_entry_id": "33965112-6ec6-3178-bc42-639f6385a8ca",
                        "source_sense_id": "ff7c3309-cb74-30d4-b95c-50681e369722",
                        "source_sense_description": "met betrekking tot arbeid of energie",
                        "target_lang_word": "énergétique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "énergétique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ffa08b0-3bea-3db2-8c14-fc26bd145426",
                                        "entry_id": "c0f5af9e-5b87-30a2-b550-07cc6b3bc995",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est en rapport positif avec l’énergie ; qui contient de l’énergie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "060114b0-2aa2-4cd5-91f3-8e38cb6d1291",
                                                "sense_id": "7ffa08b0-3bea-3db2-8c14-fc26bd145426",
                                                "text": "Cependant, avec un taux de découverture de 16,3 m³ de stérile par tonne de charbon, et compte tenu de la valeur énergétique de la houille, l'exploitation est rentable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e92e83ca-d711-4172-b367-d87e0ec78b35",
                                                "sense_id": "7ffa08b0-3bea-3db2-8c14-fc26bd145426",
                                                "text": "Le pourghère étant une plante dont l’utilisation énergétique est récente (en 1990 au Mali), les informations agronomiques et socio-économiques restent encore insuffisantes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccfa3ca0-3c50-45aa-94e3-107fe1433576",
                                                "sense_id": "7ffa08b0-3bea-3db2-8c14-fc26bd145426",
                                                "text": "L' Assemblée des Premières Nations Québec-Labrador (APNQL), qui a, à répétition, pressé les gouvernements à impliquer les Premières Nations comme partenaires dans le développement de grands projets énergétiques, a salué l'annonce et toutes les retombées positives pour les communautés innues de ce partenariat \"d'égal à égal\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "énergétique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a13b215-cb78-3d69-908d-9be24bc51949",
                                        "entry_id": "5a79c9e5-0013-3b56-bb86-a3ba127b7097",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Science de l’énergie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "physical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90ac1fc9-77fe-434f-bc34-636cd45fecde",
                                                "sense_id": "4a13b215-cb78-3d69-908d-9be24bc51949",
                                                "text": "Des hommes tels que Galilée ou Carnot, qui possédaient à un degré extraordinaire cette Intelligence des Analogies, ont ainsi créé l’Énergétique par généralisations progressives, prudentes et hardies tout ensemble, de relations expérimentales et de réalités sensibles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
